From b25d2ea70c51cc30fc669fcb7c210b189b9b10a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "John S." <john.es.saunders@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 19:31:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add persistent history + Full History browser component
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Persists the top Gallery across restarts and adds a paginated history
browser below Queue Management for browsing deep history without loading
every video as a heavyweight player.

New files (self-contained, survive upstream pulls untouched):
- shared/utils/history_persistence.py — thread-safe JSON store at
  outputs/_wangp_history.json (schema v2 with favorites). Atomic writes;
  silent failure handling; filters missing files on load.
- shared/utils/video_thumbs.py — ffmpeg first-frame extraction cached to
  outputs/_thumbs/.
- shared/utils/gallery_push.py — helper that promotes a historical entry
  into the live top Gallery's in-memory lists (dedupes + selects).
- shared/components/history_browser.py — paginated UI component (10
  rows/page). Filters: favorites-only, model, LoRAs, prompt search. Per
  row: thumbnail, prompt, meta, favorite toggle, Play, Extract Settings,
  To Video Source, To Control Video, two-click Delete (file + JSON
  entry + thumbnail).
- icons/missing_video.{png,svg} — placeholder for rows whose file has
  been deleted but whose metadata is still persisted.

Surgical wgp.py edits (~50 lines across 15 touch points):
- Import the two new modules.
- init_history_store(save_path) at module load.
- Hooks in record_file_metadata / post-processing append / eject_video /
  eject_audio / clear_deleted_files / add_videos_to_gallery.
- Seed gen["file_list"] / gen["audio_file_list"] from persistence in
  generate_video_tab; seed the top Gallery's value= with those files.
- Fold history_browser's hidden extract/to-source/to-control triggers
  into the existing button chains via gr.on so existing handlers run
  unchanged.
- build_ui + wire_events + main.load initial render.

Bundled upstream bug fix:
- finalize_generation returned gr.Gallery(selected_index=choice) with no
  value=, which Gradio 4 treats as a full replacement, wiping the
  gallery to empty on main.load. Previously harmless because file_list
  was always empty on launch; persistence exposes it. Fixed by passing
  value=gen.get("file_list", []).

Guardrails:
- Every hook is wrapped in try/except with a [history_persistence] log;
  the app never aborts on persistence failure.
- Missing files are silently filtered from the top-Gallery seed; the
  history browser keeps them visible with a placeholder so metadata
  remains reachable.
- Malformed JSON starts empty with an error log, does not crash.
- truncate_list is intentionally not hooked: it wipes in-memory
  file_list per queued generation (when clear_file_list=0) but on-disk
  history survives because appends merge via path dedupe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
